{
  "about": "Cases for the plugin passport, schema passport/1. Each case is the base passport with the fields in `change` replaced; a key may be a dotted path such as `sections.risks`, and null sets the field to null. `check` cases list the problem codes publishCheck gives at `level`, in order; `refuse` cases must fail to parse with a message containing `error`; `covers` cases ask whether the base covers a version and hash. Copy this file to check another reader agrees.",
